{"file": "荒岛我为王，女神靠边站-第77集.mp4", "ep": 77, "duration": 62.4, "segments": [{"start": 5.65, "end": 7.65, "text": "什么风把陈大管师吹上来了"}, {"start": 8.65, "end": 9.84, "text": "来谈往后的买卖"}, {"start": 10.84, "end": 12.9, "text": "换牌子了"}, {"start": 12.9, "end": 13.9, "text": "树皮烂了"}, {"start": 13.9, "end": 15.9, "text": "往后一天来两个人"}, {"start": 15.9, "end": 16.9, "text": "都到你这边上宫"}, {"start": 16.9, "end": 18.9, "text": "当天来 当天回"}, {"start": 18.9, "end": 19.9, "text": "行 两个人"}, {"start": 20.9, "end": 21.9, "text": "你舍得放两个人出来"}, {"start": 21.9, "end": 22.9, "text": "你这儿东西最权"}, {"start": 22.9, "end": 23.9, "text": "人在营地闲着"}, {"start": 23.9, "end": 24.9, "text": "你是饿着"}, {"start": 24.9, "end": 25.9, "text": "行"}, {"start": 25.9, "end": 26.9, "text": "我正好要出趟远门"}, {"start": 26.9, "end": 27.9, "text": "得多背些货"}, {"start": 28.9, "end": 29.9, "text": "两个人的活"}, {"start": 29.9, "end": 30.9, "text": "有"}, {"start": 30.9, "end": 31.9, "text": "那就听两个人"}, {"start": 31.9, "end": 32.9, "text": "条件先摆前头"}, {"start": 32.9, "end": 33.9, "text": "吃三天"}, {"start": 33.9, "end": 34.9, "text": "干砸了"}, {"start": 34.9, "end": 35.9, "text": "当天粘走"}, {"start": 35.9, "end": 36.9, "text": "帐算你头上"}, {"start": 36.9, "end": 37.9, "text": "行"}, {"start": 37.9, "end": 38.9, "text": "还有一条"}, {"start": 38.9, "end": 39.9, "text": "每天的名单"}, {"start": 39.9, "end": 40.9, "text": "送到赵雅手里"}, {"start": 40.9, "end": 41.9, "text": "谁替谁搬"}, {"start": 41.9, "end": 42.9, "text": "提前打招呼"}, {"start": 42.9, "end": 43.9, "text": "名单"}, {"start": 43.9, "end": 44.9, "text": "我来报"}, {"start": 44.9, "end": 45.9, "text": "你的账"}, {"start": 45.9, "end": 46.9, "text": "和我的账"}, {"start": 46.9, "end": 47.9, "text": "得对得上"}, {"start": 47.9, "end": 48.9, "text": "对不上"}, {"start": 48.9, "end": 50.34, "text": "活就停"}, {"start": 50.34, "end": 52.46, "text": "好"}, {"start": 52.46, "end": 53.46, "text": "这行是空的"}, {"start": 53.46, "end": 54.46, "text": "那是替补位"}, {"start": 56.46, "end": 57.46, "text": "一年也用不上一回"}, {"start": 57.46, "end": 58.62, "text": "留着"}, {"start": 58.62, "end": 60.62, "text": "是给你自己留着耗路吧"}]}